    "option": "religion:civicoption_religion",
    "pedia": "Intolerant represents a society that is extremely intolerant of all non-state religions and scientific research that could undermine their religion. An intolerant society, with the help of the church and/or the state, eradicates all non-state religions in your civilization through an inquisition. In addition, all soldiers are conditioned to fight to the death for their religion and are guaranteed a good afterlife if they do so. Intolerant is great for creating a massive religious military campaign, known as a crusade or holy war, but completely undermines all scientific and technological advancement. Examples of intolerance are Europe during the Crusades, the Spanish Inquisition, and modern Islamic Jihadists.",
